{"id":"vod_sn_38987","vodId":"38987","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"乃木坂春香的秘密","name_cn":"乃木坂春香的秘密","date":"2008-01-01","year":"2008","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/f8694fa18c7c4e1c5c40115b71a60daa.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在私立白城学园中，乃木板春香（能登麻美子 配音）是学校里无人不知无人不晓的千金小姐，每当提起她，同学们便自觉地使用起了敬语，更为其冠以了“白银星屑”和“琴键上的公主”等美名，甚至有针对她而存在的后援团，痴心地支持着春香。　　绫濑裕人（羽多野涉 配音）只是校园中及其平凡的一个男生，以他的地位和实力，绝无可能同春香有任何的交集。一次偶然中，裕人在图书馆中意外撞破了春香的秘密，原来，表面上温文尔雅知书达理的春香，实际上是一个超级御宅族！这个秘密让裕人和春香之间的屏障破裂了，两人之间的距离越来越近，渐渐产生了真挚的感情。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:06:20","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kpizvjRR5S1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/44GccR5r8D1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hJyZf7XBXs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WEHDrP3Bs11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/94aLk7SWgv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CYGRuyfWnc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qNCAQFjybC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DGxyQiwwAJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9ZuMKWZ0z71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0xhvKdqajH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/38JkcGdFMr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2mcgyU4rLa1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:51.931Z"}